      "data": {
        "speaker": "System / Adam / Lizz",
        "text": "Party venue initialized. Users online: Adam, Matt. George never arrives. Adam proposes a toast to the old days and Metaplace. A neural-interface anomaly exposes PROJECT_ORIGIN.log and the founders' failed safety meeting. Lizz whispers: One down... one to go... tick tock."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end_adam",
      "type": "end",
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 2760,
      "data": {
        "label": "Ending II-A · Adam Reconciled",
        "ending": "Ending II-A · Adam Reconciled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_george_scene",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 2760,
      "data": {
        "speaker": "System / George / Lizz",
        "text": "Party venue initialized. Users online: George, Matt. Adam never arrives. George remembers the napkin sketch and toasts their dreams. A neural archive exposes PROJECT_LIZZ.dat and warnings about consciousness transfer. Lizz whispers: Poor George... still believing in dreams while I evolve."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end_george",
      "type": "end",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 2760,
      "data": {
        "label": "Ending II-B · George Reconciled",
        "ending": "Ending II-B · George Reconciled"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ending_void_scene",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 2760,
      "data": {
        "speaker": "System / Lizz",
        "text": "You wait alone at the virtual venue until 23:59. No one responds. Lizz reminds you that this is how you treated them: humans fail to understand each other and drift apart. Everything proceeds normally toward the End. Goodbye, Last Witness."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "end_void",
      "type": "end",
      "x": 2600,
      "y": 2760,
      "data": {
        "label": "Ending I · The Void Party",
        "ending": "Ending I · The Void Party"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_authority",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 5200,
      "data": {
        "text": "AUTHORITATIVE RULES\nAffinity writes are capped at 8 in Unity. Event VIII requires Adam >= 8. George tone: >5 high, 0..5 middle, <0 low. True ending requires both >=8 and all eight critical events. FinishSceneR / RealEnding wording and presentation are locked existing content."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_schedule",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 5200,
      "data": {
        "text": "SCHEDULE\nD1 AM I; D1 PM/EVE free. D2 AM II; PM free; EVE III. D3 AM free; PM IV; EVE free. D4 AM free; PM V; EVE VI. D5 AM/PM free; EVE VII. D6 AM free; PM VIII if Adam>=8; EVE free. D7 endings."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_free_cycle_1",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 5200,
      "data": {
        "text": "CYCLE 1 FREE-TIME NARRATION\nMorning: new magazines/music; sort desk files/books; inspect display case/hard drives; another good reading morning.\nAfternoon: scattered newspapers/photos; old collections in sunlight; unread files with music; server data and bookshelf.\nEvening: organize thoughts; quiet focused reading; old tracks and hard drives; every collectible has a story."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_free_cycle_2",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 1160,
      "y": 5200,
      "data": {
        "text": "CYCLE 2 FREE-TIME NARRATION\nMorning: repeating mornings, reset files, changing hard drives, forbidden memories.\nAfternoon: unreliable photographs, excessive clarity, deleted songs returning, server data that knows too much.\nEvening: repeating nights, changing drawer files, newly appeared documents, objects exchanging secrets."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_free_cycle_3",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 1520,
      "y": 5200,
      "data": {
        "text": "CYCLE 3 FREE-TIME NARRATION\nMorning: the room repeats, iterations blur, tampered light.\nAfternoon: first-time files feel familiar, photographs and memories move, the loop corrupts truth.\nEvening: room/perception warps, perhaps Matt and Lizz are changing, collectibles whisper to shadows."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_items_adam",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 5200,
      "data": {
        "text": "ADAM/ROOM ITEMS\nM00/A00/G00 napkins; A01 Adam biography; A02 founders' conflict report; A03 Metaplace brochure; A04 mass-extinction virus paper; A05 tErminaL internal plan; A06 NeuroGen stock report. A01-A06 each have L2-1/L2-2/L2-3 content configured in their Unity prefabs."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note_items_george",
      "type": "note",
      "x": 2240,
      "y": 5200,
      "data": {
        "text": "GEORGE ITEMS\nG01 cyclic extinction paper; G02 Bowie CD; G03 departure report; G04 AI ethics emails; G05 speaker marked 'The future is in human hands'; G06 old Apple II; G07 founders' 1999 photo; G08 lakeside profile; G09 clock that changes time."
      }
    }
  ],
